      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Eight years of cluster snapshots\nExplore reported CPU, nodes and job backlog. Change the **date range** and **bucket** above; drag across a chart to zoom.\n\n**Source wall-clock time; timezone unconfirmed.** UTC display is a plotting convention only. These are cluster aggregates: per-node usage, memory, job throughput and waiting times are unavailable. Averages weight observed snapshots equally. Missing buckets stay empty; percentages above 100% are retained."
