      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Read the gaps as carefully as the peaks\nThe supplied archive produced **903,522 accepted snapshots**, **12,489 extra identical duplicates**, **937 conflicting timestamps** (all variants quarantined), and **1 rejected row**. These are full-archive cleaning totals, independent of the selected range.\n\nCPU units and collection semantics remain unconfirmed. Zero reported CPU does not prove hardware idleness. Cluster capacity changed across the archive. The daily peak table uses a 200 CPU-sample threshold (a usual five-minute day has 288 samples). Compare narrower periods before drawing operational conclusions. See `docs/analysis.md` and the companion quality CSVs."
      }
